+三个 DEVELOP 权重和十个 DeepPROTACs 权重的哈希见 [weights.json](locks/weights.json)。官方评价输入来自 [DeepPROTACs single_test 固定提交](https://github.com/Fenglei104/DeepPROTACs/tree/dfb62c4d137b7133d5ea4834a2615779630f2a52/single_test)，缓存文件见 [official-eval-inputs.json](locks/official-eval-inputs.json)。
